eft:.\n   - 9 + 1 = 10.\n   - Write down 0 in the units place of the sum and carry over 1 to the tens place.\n   - 8 + 2 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the tens place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundreds place.\n   - 7 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the hundreds place of the sum and carry over 1 to the thousands place.\n   - 6 + 4 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n   - 5 + 5 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the ten-thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundred-thousands place.\n   - 4 + 6 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the hundred-thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the millions place.\n   - 3 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the hundred-million place of the sum and carry over 1 to the ten-billion place.\n   - 2 + 8 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the ten-billion place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundred-billion place.\n   - 1 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 11.\n   - Write down 1 in the hundred-billion place of the sum and carry over 1 to the trillions place.\n3. Since there are no more digits to add, we write down the carried over 1 in the trillions place.\n4. Putting it all together, the sum is:.\n   ```.\n   123456789.\n+  987654321.\n---------.\n  1111111110.\n   ```.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, the sum of 123456789 and 987654321 is 1111111110.</answer>.<|User|>The answer is correct. Let's try one more complex problem: What is the sum of 1234567891 and 9876543211? Please solve it step by step.\n<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c><think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 1234567891 and 9876543211, we can follow the same step-by-step process as before. Let's align the numbers by their place values and add them together:.\n1. We have:.\n   ```.\n   1234567891.\n+  9876543211.\n   ```.\n2. Adding the numbers starting from the rightmost digit (th